# "Each player discards their hand, then draws seven cards" (CR 101.4, 701.9): Bot1 casts Wheel of Fortune off three Moxen with
# Lightning Bolt, Counterspell and Island still in hand; those and Bot2's seven Islands all go to the graveyards before anyone
# draws. Bot2's deck holds only ten cards, so after discarding seven its library of three gives three cards, and Bot2 loses the
# game for the draw from an empty library (CR 704.5b). Bot1's own seven are drawn in full.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Wheel of Fortune
Lightning Bolt
Counterspell
Island
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x7
Mountain x3

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Wheel of Fortune.Cast
Bot1.Pass

[Expect]
Result = Bot1 won
Bot1.Hand.Count = 7
Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 4
Bot2.Graveyard.Count = 7
Bot2.Hand.Count = 3
Bot2.Library.Count = 0
